          "path": "_m/4/w/y/1/battle-of-goose-green-wp/paratrooper-royal-marine-toget.jpg",
          "filename": "Paratrooper & Royal Marine together in death 1982.jpg",
          "caption": "Taken by author 13 June 1982 at the temporary field hospital Ajax Bay. \nThe picture shows the single grave of Corporal Stephen Hope,  3rd Battalion The Parachute Regiment, killed in action Mount Longdon.\nAlso Corporal Laurence Watts of 42 Commando Royal Marines, killed in action Mount Harriet.\nBoth servicemen's bodies were flown to Ajax Bay, San Carlos where they were interred temporarily together.\n\nWritten in Biro pen on the wooden cross (left) is 'CPL HOPE' and  on the right is 'CPL WATTS'.",
          "alt": "Taken by author 13 June 1982 at the temporary field hospital Ajax Bay. \nThe picture shows the single grave of Corporal Stephen Hope,  3rd Battalion The Parachute Regiment, killed in action Mount Longdon.\nAlso Corporal Laurence Watts of 42 Commando Royal Marines, killed in action Mount Harriet.\nBoth servicemen's bodies were flown to Ajax Bay, San Carlos where they were interred temporarily together.\n\nWritten in Biro pen on the wooden cross (left) is 'CPL HOPE' and  on the right is 'CPL WATTS'.",
          "width": 1047,
          "height": 1530,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
          "artist": "Ken Griffiths",
